    "_comment": "曝光自适应：exp_time 超阈值判为运动模糊帧。hard_action=none|skip_obstacle|drop_frame；drop_frame 会把 percep_status 置 -1，慎用。先把 log_every_n 打开量一下实际曝光再定阈值",
    "enabled": true,
    "exp_soft_ms": 8.0,
    "exp_hard_ms": 20.0,
    "gain_soft": 4.0,
    "gain_hard": 16.0,
    "min_confidence": 0.35,
